<header><p class="enc-kicker">Religion / idea · concept</p><h1 class="enc-title">Imamate</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as hidden imam</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The imamate is the Shia doctrine of leadership of the Muslim community by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/imam">imams</a> descended from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prophet-muhammad">Prophet Muhammad</a> through Ali. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ismailism">Ismaili</a> Shia belief held that a hidden imam would reappear. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fatimid-caliphate">Fatimid Caliphate</a> was founded on Ismaili claims that its rulers were the rightful imams.</p></div>
